<title>UK: SBC sets calls on basket of UK recommended stock.</title>
<headline>SBC sets calls on basket of UK recommended stock.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>SBC has issued one million American-style call warrants, on a January 1997 UK equity recommended basket, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p>The basket includes British Aerospace Plc, British Land Plc, British Telecom Plc, Caradon Plc, Dixons Group Plc, Mercury Asset Management Plc, Rolls Royce Plc, Royal &amp; Sun Alliance Insurance Group Plc and J. Sainsbury Plc.</p>
<p>One warrant refers to one shre of the underlying.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    10.65 STG		 PREMIUM	11.4 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     0.63 STG		  GEARING	16.1 X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	31.DEC.97		 PAYDATE	13.JAN.97</p>
<p> MIN EXER LOT    1000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  10.13 STG</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
